Relinking
---------
Under LGPL v3 you have the right to replace the Qt libraries with your own
version. See README.md for the per-platform relink workflow:

    pixi run relink <platform> --arch <arch> --qt-dir <path-to-Qt>

FFI plugins (non-Qt shared libraries) do not link against Qt and are not
subject to Qt relinking.
